  <NAME>Physcomitrium patens</NAME>
  <TITLE>Changes of histone modification induced by STEMIN1 in the moss Physcomitrella patens</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>This project revealed that H3K27me3 level on STEMIN1-target genes decreased after STEMIN1 induction. Since the decrease of H3K27me3 occurred before cell division, chromatin modifications caused by STEMIN1 induction is independent from cell divisions.</DESCRIPTION>
